{"sourceUrl":"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/sylm/tzgg/d5c72b031f5e495bad41a4adac581de6.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:16.690033+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/sylm/tzgg/d5c72b031f5e495bad41a4adac581de6.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>根</span></span><span><span>据《</span></span><span><span>北京工商大学接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作管理办法</span></span><span><span>》和《北京工商大学关于开展</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收免试攻读硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>工作的通知</span></span><span><span>》的工作要求</span></span><span><span>，法学院按如下方案开展接收</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6级</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>工作</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.获得推荐免试资格的全日制普通高校的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.符合</span><span><span>我院各专业接收推免生的条件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.身体健康状况符合国家和学校规定的体检要求</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span><span>申请专业与本科所学专业应当相同或相近，原则上不得跨一级学科报考。申请法律（非法学）专业学位的推免生，本科所学专业须为非法学专业（普通高等学校本科专业目录法学门类中的法学类专业</span></span><span>[代码为0301]毕业生不得申请）；申请法律（法学）专业学位的推免生，本科所学专业须为法学专业（仅普通高等学校本科专业目录法学门类中的法学类专业[代码为0301]毕业生可以申请）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.四级或六级成绩单、在校学习成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.发表的学术论文、著作、教材、专利或其他可体现学术能力的成果和获奖证书（须提交原件的扫描件）；</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>3.《</span></span><span><span>北京工商大学</span></span><span><span>硕士推免生入学复试个人陈述表</span></span><span><span>》扫描件（要求手写签名</span><span>,多于一页的请分开扫描</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>（见附件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>《北京工商大学硕士研究生政审函调表》扫描件（</span></span><span><span>由考生本人所在学校政工部门加盖印章</span></span><span><span>, 要求手写签名，多于一页的请分开扫描）（见附件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.本人身份证复印件（正反面）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>正式报名时，上述材料通过教育部推免系统上传扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.预报名</span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>登录北京工商大学预报名系统进行预报名。</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>登录网址</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><a href=\"https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10011/user/login/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10011/user/login/login</span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名时间截止至</span></span><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>9月2</span></strong><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span>00</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> <span>2.正式报名</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>登录教育部</span><span>“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（简称“推免服务系统”）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>进行报名。</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>正式报名是接收推免生的必要环节，系统将在</span><span>9月22日9:00开通推免生报名功能，所有报名推免生的考生均应及时登录报名（登录中国研究生招生信息网http://yz.chsi.com.cn/，注册后填报学生信息并提交有关材料）。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.复试原则 </span></p>\n<p><span><span>坚持公开、公平、公正原则，在对考生进行全面考查的基础上，实行择优选拔。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.复试</span><span><span>时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将于</span><span>9月23日9:00后通过“推免服务系统”发送复试通知，请推免生及时在系统中确认。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试具体时间</span></span><span><span>另行通知，请及时</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>邮箱、手机短信并保持手机畅通</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.复试形式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>采取</span></span><span><span>双机位线上面试，线上面试流程及要求</span></span><span><span>见附件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>复试内容及</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试主要考察学生的综合素质和专业理论知识，包括英语口语听力水平、语言表达、逻辑思维、学习目标等。总成绩</span><span>(100分)=综合素质面试（70分）+英语（30分），总成绩低于60分为不及格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核主要通过人事档案审查（政审）、《国家教育考试考生诚信档案》对考生诚信状况进行核查。考生填写硕士研究生政审函调表（</span></span><span><span>见</span></span><span><span>附件）由本人所在学校政工部门加盖印章，方为有效。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>学院根据复试成绩确定拟接收推免生名单，并进行公示，</span></span><span><span>面试成绩</span></span><span>60分（含）以上者方可录取，面试成绩低于60分者不能录取。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>学院通过教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”向申请者发出《拟录取通知》。申请者在“推免服务系统”回复确认后，即取得北京工商大学推免生录取资格，逾期未确认者视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>  3. 若申请人提交的信息不准确或不真实，一经发现，立即取消其推免生资格，并通报申请人所在学校。</span></p>\n<p><span>  4. 所有推免生只能录取为全日制非定向就业</span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>研究生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>  5. 学校录取的推免生将获得一等新生奖学金。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、学制</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学术型硕士</span></span><span>3年</span></p>\n<p><span><span>专业学位硕士</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>法律</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>非法学</span></span><span><span>）</span><span>3年，法律（法学）2年。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><span><span>、</span></span><strong><span><span>招生咨询</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：王老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：（</span></span><span>010）81353346</span><span><span>（良乡校区）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮件信箱：</span></span><span><span>wangdanjun@btbu.edu.cn</span></span>  </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、</span> <span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年法学院接收推免生计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>推免生拟接收人数</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（可根据实际报名情况调整）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030105</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>民商法学</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>      5</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030106</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>诉讼法学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030107</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>经济法学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>030109</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>国际法学</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>035101</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法律（非法学）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>035102</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>法律（法学）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>人</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong><span><span>九</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、体检</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>所有拟录取推免生须在拟录取后进行体检，可待</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6年</span></span><span><span>统考硕士研究生体检要求出台后再执行</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/15a3d074d56a4e9590499b163042bb25.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：北京工商大学硕士推免生入学复试个人陈述表</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/3d05f3b6998849888eaa0b6aeab586bd.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：北京工商大学硕士研究生政审函调表</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://law.btbu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/650a4cde5de14fca997e0c49c41296b9.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：北京工商大学法学院接收推免生面试程序与规范</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                          <span>北京工商大学法学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>              202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span></span>（作者：王丹君    编辑：周升顺    审核：刘冰     审定：陈敦）</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"0aac8e8a1cd1b730b5149a19b044e315ce5ad4720226f32e6705807a43f3c3e2","textLength":1885,"sourceSha256":"d8bf1580c61158f2864f1e7cc675bb1d85b66ce7efc8d98362a02b5ce5b47d9e","selector":"article-like:article02","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9e6af5063b51743b7370","title":"2025年北京工商大学法学院关于接收2026年免试攻读硕士研究生工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:16.690033+00:00"}
